WEBVTT

00:10:29.648 --> 00:10:31.279
starting with 25-down,

00:10:31.279 --> 00:10:32.185
it says,

00:10:32.185 --> 00:10:33.958
"Oh, by the way,

00:10:33.958 --> 00:10:38.270
the sheep can be left blank."

00:10:38.270 --> 00:10:42.706
(Laughter) (Applause)

00:10:42.706 --> 00:10:44.280
But wait, wait, wait, there's one more thing,

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:45.483
there's one more thing,

00:10:45.483 --> 00:10:48.322
there's one final piece of the puzzle.

00:10:48.322 --> 00:10:52.641
Gwen, I am so grateful for your choices

00:10:52.641 --> 00:10:54.632
because if we take a look

00:10:54.632 --> 00:10:56.863
at the first letters of your combinations,

00:10:56.863 --> 00:10:59.875
we get "C-H-A-O-S" for chaos

00:10:59.875 --> 00:11:02.698
and "O-R-D-E-R" for order.